{"id":"n87770-1-9","stage":5,"title":"휘감다 · 围绕","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87770-1-9-1","ko":"이 옷은 너한테 너무 헐렁하지 않아?","zh":"这件衣服对你来说不会太宽松吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"옷은","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷은","audio":"/audio/61c9a5bcd1a9d1f0aaed.mp3"}},{"text":"너한테","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너한테","audio":"/audio/5fa76a3e890a321be5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"헐렁하지","meaning":"晃荡，宽松","explanation":"헐렁하다：晃荡，宽松；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"헐렁하다","audio":"/audio/d88d5fdc4eeba3dc0d1b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86814","senseId":"1","lemma":"헐렁하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헐렁하지","audio":"/audio/b4fb620022edbb7b34ea.mp3"}},{"text":"않아?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아","audio":"/audio/691c8d98a5312caac1ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"d88d5fdc4eeba3dc","term":"헐렁하다","zh":"晃荡，宽松","audio":"/audio/d88d5fdc4eeba3dc0d1b.mp3","entryId":"86814","definition":"太大不贴合，有松动的感觉。","pronunciation":["헐렁하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/55cbefb82888b0907775.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87770-1-9-2","ko":"바지에 허리띠를 휘감아서 입으면 돼.","zh":"可以在裤子上缠条腰带来穿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바지에","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지에","audio":"/audio/e179d826faf78c9ed60e.mp3"}},{"text":"허리띠를","meaning":"腰带","explanation":"허리띠：腰带；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"허리띠","audio":"/audio/a153ea0b00b01579a5a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87687","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리띠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리띠를","audio":"/audio/b90b724040f8d260abd1.mp3"}},{"text":"휘감아서","meaning":"围绕，缠绕","explanation":"휘감다：围绕，缠绕；어서：连